engineering, agentic tool use, and office productivity workflows. It is presented as a model deeply participating in its own evolution, with support for complex agent harnesses, dynamic tool search, Agent Teams, and...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"820f294f49ee2d0d\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"docs.api.nvidia.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c47c63bc8814c565\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nRate Limits - MiniMax API Docs\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c47c63bc8814c565\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://platform.minimax.io/docs/guides/rate-limits\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c7786c7d83f883af\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nRate limits are restrictions that our API imposes on the number of times a user or client can access our services within a specified period of time.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c7786c7d83f883af\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"platform.minimax.io\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"13076f66bb48d023\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGitHub - MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-M2.7\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"13076f66bb48d023\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c1d6b53a9e52273f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMiniMax - M2 .7 is our first model deeply participating in its own evolution. M2.7 is capable of building complex agent harnesses and completing highly elaborate productivity tasks, leveraging Agent Teams, complex Skills, and dynamic tool search. For more details, see our blog post.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c1d6b53a9e52273f\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"github.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1679950e15005c8c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMiniMax-M2 Series Usage Guide - vLLM Recipes\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1679950e15005c8c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/recipes/en/latest/MiniMax/MiniMax-M2.html\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7129b7e0ffdd2fc4\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe following examples use MiniMax - M2 .7: MiniMaxAI / MiniMax - M2 .7 MiniMaxAI / MiniMax - M2 .5 MiniMaxAI / MiniMax - M2 .1 MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2 Usage System Requirements OS: Linux Python: 3.10 - 3.13 GPU requirements NVIDIA GPU compute capability 7.0 or higher Memory requirements: 220 GB for weights, 240 GB per 1M context tokens AMD GPU\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7129b7e0ffdd2fc4\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"docs.vllm.ai\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"776e32a040888fa6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNVIDIA API 讓你完全免費呼叫 Minimax M2.7、DeepSeek V4 模型，也能用在 OpenClaw 與 Hermes\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"776e32a040888fa6\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.koc.com.tw/archives/638837\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"03638d420888adea\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n稀宇科技近日開源的 Minimax M2.7 模型，很多人一定都想玩玩看，不僅支援 Agent、工具調用和多任務，更具備「自我演化（Self-Evolution）」的能力，聽起來就相當強，只不過 230B 這麼大的參數量，絕大多數人的電腦一定跑不動。而這篇就要來告訴你一個好消息， NVIDIA 的免費 API 就能呼叫這款 Minimax M2.7 ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"03638d420888adea\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.koc.com.tw\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779337058430},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"callfe9a9f3e83b541b7b4b9e69ed89bc415","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"maxChars":3000,"url":"https://docs.api.nvidia.com/nim/reference/minimaxai-minimax-m2.7"},"partialArgs":"{\"maxChars\":3000,\"url\":\"https://docs.api.nvidia.com/nim/reference/minimaxai-minimax-m2.7\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"